WEBVTT

00:02:27.351 --> 00:02:31.022
and they told me about an initiative
they sponsored called the Girl Effect.

00:02:31.564 --> 00:02:35.234
They promoted adolescent girls
as the key to improving societies

00:02:35.276 --> 00:02:36.944
around the globe.

00:02:36.986 --> 00:02:39.280
They said they believed
in women and girls.

00:02:39.322 --> 00:02:40.990
And if I joined Nike,

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:42.325
I could empower them.

00:02:42.325 --> 00:02:43.868
And I believed that.

00:02:44.452 --> 00:02:45.703
But guess what?

00:02:45.703 --> 00:02:48.206
Girls come from somewhere.

00:02:48.247 --> 00:02:49.874
(Laughter)

00:02:49.916 --> 00:02:53.169
And women having babies
during childrearing years

00:02:53.169 --> 00:02:56.047
is something that should be
celebrated, not punished.

00:02:56.047 --> 00:02:59.926
It should be a part of a normal, thriving,
professional, athletic career.

00:02:59.967 --> 00:03:02.762
And women in all fields
should never feel the need